 --&gt;|Baca| d_stock\r\n    report --&gt;|Baca| d_opname\r\n    report --&gt;|Baca| d_history\r\n    report --&gt;|Dashboard, laporan, ekspor| operator&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="44">
